1. app/main.py — Application Entry Point
This is the core of the service — where everything starts.

python
# Typical contents:
from fastapi import FastAPI          # or Flask
from app.services import invoice, tax
from app.db import get_db

app = FastAPI()

@app.post("/api/billings")
def create_billing(...):
    # 1. Receive billing request
    # 2. Call tax service to compute taxes
    # 3. Call invoice service to generate invoice
    # 4. Persist in database
    # 5. Return response
Responsibilities:

Initializes the web framework (FastAPI/Flask)
Starts the HTTP server on a port (e.g., 8000)
Defines API routes (the request/response endpoints)
Orchestrates the flow: request → tax → invoice → DB → response
Registers middleware (auth, logging, error handling)
