Architecture Highlights
Layer	File	Role
Entry/Controller	main.py	Receives HTTP requests, orchestrates flow
Business Logic	services/	Tax + invoice computation
Domain Models	models.py	Data structures and validation
Persistence	db.py	Database connectivity
Config	requirements.txt + Dockerfile	Packaging & deployment
This follows a clean layered architecture — separation of concerns where each file has a single, focused responsibility.
